  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 03a: Master Orchestrator Internals

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: Into the Orchestrator" (0:06–0:14)**
  Camera: Start zoomed out showing the full dispatch flow (07-d-orchestrator-dispatch-flow.mmd)
  as a distant glassmorphism cityscape. FPV drone accelerates toward the Master Orchestrator
  node — a large frosted Deep Cobalt (#1a1f3a) cube with purple (#7b61ff) neon filaments
  pulsing inside. The drone punches through the glass surface (shatter-refraction effect,
  blur: 20px) and enters the interior. Inside: a vast Midnight Blue (#0a0e27) vacuum
  space populated with internal component nodes.

  **SCENE 3 — "Component Cascade" (0:14–0:26)**
  Internal components materialize as frosted glassmorphism capsules, each with neon
  filaments. Entry Point glows green (#00ff88) — a bioluminescent request particle
  spawns here, leaving a neon light-trail as it flows:
  - Entry Point → Request Validator (cyan filament pulse)
  - Validator → Intent Classifier (particle brightens)
  - Classifier connects to the Intelligence Layer: four capsules — UIP, CDL, ADOCtx,
    KGIdx — light up in rapid sequence with cyan (#00d4ff) neon filaments. Each capsule
    has a "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scanning internal data.
  - Intelligence Layer feeds Orchestrator Router (amber glow, Deep Cobalt glass)

  **SCENE 4 — "The Routing Decision" (0:26–0:36)**
  Router fans out five glassmorphism paths to target orchestrators — OnboardingOrch,
  TDDOrch, PlanningOrch, SweepOrch, Domain Orchestrators. Only ONE path illuminates
  per request (purple neon filament traces the selected route); the others dim to 20%.
  The particle travels the selected path, executes, and returns.
  LearningMixin capsule pulses purple (#7b61ff) on completion — confidence score
  animates inside as a floating number. ErrorHandler path shown as a dotted red
  (#ff4444) ghost trail for error cases — particle bounces back with a red flash.

  **SCENE 5 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:36–0:46)**
  Camera: Pulls out through the glass wall (reverse shatter-refraction). Now outside,
  360-degree orbital pan around the Master Orchestrator cube. Internal components
  visible through the frosted glass — all glowing at full luminosity. Ray-traced
  reflections on surrounding fog. Camera completes orbit, pulls back.
  Architecture fades to 40%. Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes
  center-frame — sealed document with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
